  "description": "Reheating a leftover steak will almost inevitably lead to dry, disappointing results. Inspired by Japanese tataki, this cold steak and cucumber salad is a much better alternative. The ponzu vinaigrette is made with whole grain mustard and olive oil, for a great East–West twist on a classic dish.",
  "notes": "Optional or for serving: Small dab prepared wasabi (optional)\n\nNotes: This recipe can easily be scaled to use as much or as little steak as you'd like. Scale the sauce ingredients and use as much cucumber and scallion as you wish.",
